        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Idyllic 3 Bedroom Detached Bungalow extending to 107.85 sq. m (1,161 sq. ft) and set on over an Acre with outbuildings and a Yard.\r\n\r\nThis is a unique residence which has huge potential to add value. It has the country feel yet is very conveniently located only minutes from Dunmanway Town Centre.\r\n\r\nThe house itself is a single storey residence with a lovely layout and it is in fair condition. The accommodation comprises of Entrance Hall, Living Room, Dining Room, Kitchen, Pantry, 3 Double Bedrooms and a family Bathroom.\r\n\r\nIt has a wonderful elevated rural situation with south facing views over the rolling landscape. To the front of the property there is a sweeping tarmac driveway flanked by mature trees and plenty of off street car parking. To the rear there is a selection of outbuildings and a yard.\r\n\r\nThe property is located very conveniently, its 5km north of Dunmanway town centre. Dunmanway is a bustling market town with supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, medical services, primary and secondary schools, fitness and leisure facilities, and a strong community atmosphere.\r\n\r\nThe property also enjoys excellent connectivity to many well-known West Cork destinations. It is only 20 minutes to Clonakilty, 25 minutes to Bantry, 45 minutes to Cork International Airport and Cork City is 50 minutes away.\r\n\r\nFeatures–\r\n\r\nPrivate Drainage and Water\r\n\r\nOFCH\r\n\r\nEircode: P47 TW22 (Property Specific Code)\r\n\r\nViewing Is Highly Recommended – By Appointment Only\r\n\r\nDisclaimer: All information provided is to the best of our knowledge but is not guaranteed and should be independently verified. No warranties or representations are made regarding the accuracy, completeness, condition or planning status of the property. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of all information provided, including measurements, boundaries, size or acreage, BER details and services. All measurements and distances are approximate and for guidance only. Photographs and video are for illustrative purposes and may include items not included in the sale (e.g. furniture)."
